{color.GG}openfile.conf {color.N}defines file aliases and the custom theme used by {color.GG}openfile{color.N}.

Example {color.GG}openfile.conf{color.N}:
{color.DG}# comment{color.N}
{color.PP}openfile.theme {color.WW}= {color.YY}path/to/theme.micro{color.N}
{color.PP}myalias {color.WW}= {color.YY}path/to/file{color.N}

Usage:
    {color.R}- {color.GG}openfile {color.CC}<alias|file>{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}openfile {color.CC}--list-alias{color.N}

Aliases map shortcut names to file paths.
openfile.theme specifies the custom Micro editor theme.
Both entries support variable expansion and ~.